repository-code: "https://github.com/dr-richard-barker/clpds-planetary-visualization"
url: "https://dr-richard-barker.github.io/clpds-planetary-visualization"
abstract: >-
  FAIR-compliant open-source data processing pipeline and WebGL
  visualization suite for China's Lunar and Planetary Data System
  (CLPDS), covering Chang'e-1 through 6 lunar missions and Tianwen-1
  Zhurong Mars rover data. Integrates 3D planetary globes, ground-penetrating
  radar subsurface stratigraphy (LPR and RoRAD), Vis-NIR and LIBS
  spectroscopy laboratories, and Martian weather timeseries.
keywords:
  - CLPDS
  - Chang'e mission
  - Tianwen-1
  - Zhurong rover
  - Lunar Penetrating Radar
  - RoRAD
  - Spectroscopy
  - LIBS
  - Planetary Science
  - FAIR data
